              },
              "help": {
                "text": "",
                "markdown": "* Package Manager: npm\n* Vulnerable module: funny-pad\n* Introduced through: api@1.0.0 and funny-pad@0.0.1-security\n### Detailed paths\n* _Introduced through_: api@1.0.0 › funny-pad@0.0.1-security\n# Overview\n[funny-pad](https://www.npmjs.org/package/funny-pad) is a malicious package.\nThis package contains malicious code, and its content was removed from the official package manager. While this package might be attempting to impersonate a valid organization, there is no connection between that organization and this package authorship.\n# Remediation\nAvoid using all malicious instances of the `funny-pad` package.\n# References\n- [NPM Security Placeholder](https://npmjs.com/package/funny-pad)\n"
              },
              "properties": {
                "tags": [
                  "security",
                  "CWE-506",
                  "npm"
                ],
                "cvssv3_baseScore": 9.3,
                "security-severity": "9.3"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "SNYK-JS-REACTIFYUTILS-13644420",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Critical severity - Malicious Package vulnerability in reactify-utils"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "reactify-utils@0.0.1-security"
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "",
                "markdown": "* Package Manager: npm\n* Vulnerable module: reactify-utils\n* Introduced through: api@1.0.0 and reactify-utils@0.0.1-security\n### Detailed paths\n* _Introduced through_: api@1.0.0 › reactify-utils@0.0.1-security\n# Overview\n[reactify-utils](https://www.npmjs.org/package/reactify-utils) is a malicious package.\nThis package contains malicious code, and its content was removed from the official package manager. While this package might be attempting to impersonate a valid organization, there is no connection between that organization and this package authorship.\n# Remediation\nAvoid using all malicious instances of the `reactify-utils` package.\n# References\n- [NPM Security Placeholder](https://npmjs.com/package/reactify-utils)\n"
              },
